275
00:31:36,880 --> 00:31:38,160
-Because…
-Because of what?

276
00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:42,640
She was caught
stealing organs from corpses.

277
00:31:43,480 --> 00:31:45,920
But the medical team

278
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:48,000
concluded that she was suffering
from mental illness,

279
00:31:48,080 --> 00:31:49,920
so she was never prosecuted.

280
00:31:50,360 --> 00:31:52,280
The university didn't want
to make a big issue out of it.

281
00:31:56,360 --> 00:31:57,520
It was very terrifying.

282
00:32:05,600 --> 00:32:08,760
The killer had been cutting off fingers…
Removing internal organs…

283
00:32:09,440 --> 00:32:10,800
Even the victims' genitals…

284
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,360
from the bodies.

285
00:33:16,760 --> 00:33:20,320
You seem to enjoy cutting flesh.

286
00:33:27,120 --> 00:33:28,480
I've been doing it my whole life.

287
00:33:29,560 --> 00:33:31,720
I've heard that everyone is born

288
00:33:31,800 --> 00:33:34,720
with the instinct to carve up flesh
and eat it among ourselves.

289
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:37,560
Like those cannibal tribes.

290
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:41,600
From the moment we're born,
we're always hungry…

291
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:43,280
Always hunting for something.

292
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,880
Always carving away…

293
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:47,520
Just to survive.

294
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,760
You're a very interesting person.

295
00:34:05,120 --> 00:34:06,480
Have you seen Nai lately?

296
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:09,960
I've heard you two have been spending
a lot of time together.

297
00:34:57,600 --> 00:34:59,840
I'm also a farmer,

298
00:35:00,720 --> 00:35:03,480
I truly understand the struggles
of every one of you.

299
00:35:04,720 --> 00:35:06,120
I promise you this,

300
00:35:06,360 --> 00:35:10,600
I'll make sure prices
don't fall any further.

301
00:35:12,080 --> 00:35:15,200
And another matter,
I'll restore peace and

302
00:35:15,600 --> 00:35:18,200
safety to our village.

303
00:35:20,640 --> 00:35:22,280
Vote for me,

304
00:35:22,640 --> 00:35:24,160
Chawin, Number One.

305
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:27,920
I'll bring peace

306
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:29,840
and security

307
00:35:29,920 --> 00:35:32,880
back to our community once again.

308
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:39,760
Mr. Chawin!
Mr. Chawin!

309
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:41,480
Mr. Chawin! What's wrong?

310
00:35:41,560 --> 00:35:43,760
Help, Mr. Chawin fainted!

311
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:46,560
Mr. Chawin! Mr. Chawin fainted! Help!

312
00:35:58,920 --> 00:35:59,920
Inspector,

313
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:02,240
are you sure it's buried under here?

314
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:03,600
Of course I'm sure.

315
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:05,520
I remember this rock.

316
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:07,640
The water level
wasn't this high back then.

317
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:09,320
Less talking. Just dig.

318
00:36:09,600 --> 00:36:10,600
Yes, sir.

319
00:37:07,320 --> 00:37:08,520
Sorry. I…

320
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:27,320
Go away!

321
00:37:28,640 --> 00:37:30,640
Go away!
Go away!

322
00:37:30,720 --> 00:37:31,720
Go away!

323
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:46,600
Inspector, I think…

324
00:37:53,200 --> 00:37:54,960
Dammit!

325
00:37:58,560 --> 00:37:59,760
You can't enter, Inspector.

326
00:38:12,520 --> 00:38:13,520
Chawin.

327
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,480
Where's the body?

328
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:20,000
I said where is the body?

329
00:38:20,680 --> 00:38:22,320
Have you gone crazy?

330
00:38:22,960 --> 00:38:24,360
Speak!

331
00:38:24,600 --> 00:38:26,240
I said where is the body?

332
00:38:26,320 --> 00:38:27,720
Who took the body?

333
00:38:28,120 --> 00:38:30,200
If you lose your mind, we're all screwed!

334
00:38:30,640 --> 00:38:32,040
Where is the body, Chawin?

335
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:37,000
Hey!

336
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,400
Snap out of it.

337
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:40,440
I said where is the body?

338
00:38:40,520 --> 00:38:41,720
Who took the body?

339
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:44,480
Speak! Who took the body?

340
00:38:46,520 --> 00:38:48,200
Dammit!

341
00:38:52,320 --> 00:38:53,720
Dammit!

342
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:01,240
What much is it?

343
00:39:03,600 --> 00:39:05,000
Deliver the food too.

344
00:39:39,320 --> 00:39:41,480
Wait, it's me.
It's me.

345
00:39:41,560 --> 00:39:42,800
Promise me, if I let go,
you won't scream, okay?

346
00:39:46,720 --> 00:39:48,400
I need to talk to you.

347
00:39:48,480 --> 00:39:49,760
About what?

348
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:51,360
About Pan.
